{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21742","headline":"余杭周从事以十章见寄词调清婉难於遍酬聊和诗首篇以荅来贶 · 元稹","name":"余杭周从事以十章见寄词调清婉难於遍酬聊和诗首篇以荅来贶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扰扰纷纷旦暮间，经营闲事不曾闲。\n多缘老病推辞酒，少有功夫久羡山。\n清夜笙歌喧四郭，黄昏钟漏下重关。\n何由得似周从事，醉入人家醒始还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21742.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21742","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}